WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
I've carried enough

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,320
I also said, life or death does not matter

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:05,560
I am an orphan and grew up in the mountains.

4
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:06,960
The master has already gone first

5
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:09,680
I have no parents, no relatives, no friends, no worries

6
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:10,720
What day does life and death really happen?

7
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:11,880
No one will be sad for me

8
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:12,800
You don't have to feel guilty

9
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:13,840
I chose the road myself

10
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:14,920
I won't regret it

11
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:20,440
Captain, you can't do without me

12
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:27,100
take you up

13
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,520
It's this room

14
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:33,180
It's this one, but the window is locked

15
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:34,600
It doesn't matter

16
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,750
The captain is Uncle Ning Yan

17
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:39,620
Why do people here like to use windows?

18
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:41,580
What if you go wrong?

19
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:44,110
It's okay. I'll be back in a while.

20
00:00:44,110 --> 00:00:46,750
Do you have time on Sunday? Yes

21
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:48,030
Book a training ground

22
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:49,390
I teach you to fly

23
00:00:49,390 --> 00:00:51,350
Mom, I saw Wen Chen at Zhongzhou University

24
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:53,350
It’s really great that she’s studying at CUHK

25
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:55,790
Your father will definitely agree to her coming back, but

26
00:00:55,790 --> 00:00:57,430
She doesn't seem to want to come back

27
00:00:57,430 --> 00:00:58,830
The Su family is a wealthy family in Zhongzhou

28
00:00:58,830 --> 00:01:01,470
She just cares about her husband's attitude and Xiaoyun is waiting for your dad to agree

29
00:01:01,470 --> 00:01:02,670
Let's talk to her again
